{
 "encounter_id": "00936",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't see the board at school. I'm squinting all the time, and the teacher's moved me to the front twice, so my mum made me come."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks for coming, Leo. Squinting at the board. How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since the start of term. About four months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it only the board, or other things too?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Anything far away. Road signs, the football pitch. Everything's blurry past about ten metres."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you get headaches?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "By the afternoon, yeah, across the front."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do your eyes feel tired?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Really tired and sore. Especially after gaming."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you sit close to the screen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right up close, yeah. Mum shouts at me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, would you like his notes from the school? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In a minute, nurse. Leo, any double vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No double vision."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pain in the eyes themselves?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Red eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, they're not red."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any flashes of light or floaters?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No flashes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Montelukast, 10 mg, at night. And cetirizine, 10 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I got a rash when I was little."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, eczema, hay fever, and migraines sometimes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Adenoids out, when I was six."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Eye problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mum's short-sighted. And my dad has glaucoma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What year are you in?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Year eleven. GCSEs, so I need to see the board."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And screens?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gaming, about four hours a night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sport?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Football on Saturdays. I can't see the ball coming."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who do you live with?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum, dad, and my sister."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse 68, blood pressure 112 over 68, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, and weight 62 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All fine. Nurse, put the chart up. Cover your left eye, Leo. Read the smallest line you can.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "E, D, F... I can't see the next one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The right eye reads 6/12. Now cover the right."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's worse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Left eye reads 6/18."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both eyes are below normal for distance. Now look at my light. Your pupils are equal and react normally."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your eye movements are full, with no squint."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what is it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problem with your balance or dizziness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This looks like short-sightedness, myopia, which is very common at your age."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will I need glasses? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very likely. I'd like to arrange a full eye test with the optometrist, a retinal photograph, and a test with drops to measure your exact prescription."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll book the optometrist for this week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to do a colour vision test while you're here."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That one's fun. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take screen breaks every twenty minutes, and get outside in daylight more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fair enough. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the headaches haven't settled four weeks after you get glasses, come back and see us."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, thanks. ~"
  }
 ],
